  "scope": "Genuine unchanged product source and native/raw/optimized classes before caching the fitField character-loop bound. Whole native fitField has a cached text length before its StringBuffer/loop on all platforms. Old raw fitField and optimized getItemText call text.length in the loop condition instead. Existing native/raw FormProbe output already matched (6149 observations, 2562 raster frames); no functional negative fixture is invented. This records a source structure difference, not a demonstrated user-visible failure.",
